WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.374 --> 00:00:03.624
Unit eleven. Happy, Sad and Angry!

2
00:00:04.595 --> 00:00:08.313
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.363 --> 00:00:11.549
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.599 --> 00:00:15.798
Today we learn about Happy, Sad and Angry. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.286 --> 00:00:20.769
Happy. Say it with me. Happy!

6
00:00:24.254 --> 00:00:27.687
Sad. Say it with me. Sad!

7
00:00:31.186 --> 00:00:34.686
Angry. Say it with me. Angry!

8
00:00:38.185 --> 00:00:41.651
Scared. Say it with me. Scared!

9
00:00:45.151 --> 00:00:48.851
Feelings. Say it with me. Feelings!

10
00:00:52.351 --> 00:00:55.718
Talk. Say it with me. Talk!

11
00:00:59.227 --> 00:01:02.510
Hug. Say it with me. Hug!

12
00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:09.137
Calm. Say it with me. Calm!

13
00:01:12.679 --> 00:01:22.251
Sometimes I feel happy, sad, angry, or scared. All feelings are okay. When I have big feelings, I talk to a grown-up I trust or ask for a hug to feel calm.

14
00:01:22.301 --> 00:01:23.573
I can do that too!

15
00:01:24.944 --> 00:01:30.249
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:30.299 --> 00:01:31.449
Angry!

17
00:01:32.369 --> 00:01:37.647
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:37.697 --> 00:01:38.847
Hug!

19
00:01:39.567 --> 00:01:44.736
Did you know? Everyone has feelings — even grown-ups feel sad or scared sometimes!

20
00:01:44.786 --> 00:01:46.890
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:48.367 --> 00:01:55.829
Think and answer. What can you do when you feel sad?

22
00:01:55.879 --> 00:01:57.029
Great answer!

23
00:01:58.143 --> 00:02:03.021
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:03.071 --> 00:02:05.637
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

